    "snapshot": {
      "scope": {
        "text": "## Project Scope\n\nSpiritualized Language Tutor is a full-stack AI-powered language learning platform designed to help users improve English communication through natural conversation, personalized feedback, and adaptive learning experiences.\n\nThe scope of this project includes the design and development of a secure authentication system, AI-driven classroom environment, personalized Learning Spaces, progress tracking, tutor memory, mistake analysis, CEFR-based proficiency evaluation, and administrative content management tools. The platform will support multiple learning modes including Conversation, Reading, Listening, Writing, Speaking, and Quizzes, while continuously analyzing user performance across key linguistic competencies.\n\nThe system will leverage modern AI technologies to provide contextual corrections, personalized recommendations, session summaries, and long-term learning adaptation based on user behavior and historical performance. Future phases will extend the platform with real-time voice interactions, pronunciation coaching, and immersive voice-to-voice tutoring powered by OpenAI Realtime APIs.\n\nThe final solution aims to serve both as a practical educational product and as a showcase of modern AI engineering, conversational AI orchestration, adaptive learning systems, and scalable SaaS architecture.",
        "sha256": "af0a982e59afaa7bdbc7a8c8d9deee81b59c458f2fdb1dd3378e2fbcb5e49c4e"
      },
